    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number}, pick {pick_number} of {picks_per_hand}; every hand now holds the same number of cards. Every player's tableau, puddings and score are public. Your own state, with your private hand:"
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "pick",
      "label": "prepare the offer",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "pick",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in ['Tempura', 'Sashimi', 'Dumpling', 'Maki-1', 'Maki-2', 'Maki-3', 'Salmon Nigiri', 'Squid Nigiri', 'Egg Nigiri', 'Pudding', 'Wasabi'] if c in you.hand]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "pick",
      "label": "pick a card",
      "when": {
        "calc": "any(len(p.hand) > 1 for p in players)"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "len(you.hand) > 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "pick",
      "text": "Secretly choose one card from your hand to keep. Everyone chooses at the same moment; all choices are revealed together, and the rest of your hand passes to the player on your left."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "pick",
      "label": "last card taken automatically",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "len(you.hand) == 1"
            },
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand[0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "reveal",
      "do": [
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tableau",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.pick"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} reveals {value}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "record the picks",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick == 'Tempura'"
            },
            "key": "tempura",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick == 'Sashimi'"
            },
            "key": "sashimi",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick == 'Dumpling'"
            },
            "key": "dumplings",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick in ['Maki-1', 'Maki-2', 'Maki-3']"
            },
            "key": "maki",
            "value": {
              "calc": "maki_icons_1 if you.pick == 'Maki-1' else (maki_icons_2 if you.pick == 'Maki-2' else maki_icons_3)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick == 'Pudding'"
            },
            "key": "puddings",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick == 'Wasabi'"
            },
            "key": "wasabi_unused",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick in ['Egg Nigiri', 'Salmon Nigiri', 'Squid Nigiri']"
            },
            "key": "nigiri_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(egg_value if you.pick == 'Egg Nigiri' else (salmon_value if you.pick == 'Salmon Nigiri' else squid_value)) * (wasabi_multiplier if you.wasabi_unused >= 1 else 1)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.pick in ['Egg Nigiri', 'Salmon Nigiri', 'Squid Nigiri'] and you.wasabi_unused >= 1"
            },
            "key": "wasabi_unused",
            "value": -1,
            "text": "Seat {player} places the nigiri on a wasabi: its value is tripled."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "pass left",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "incoming",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[you.seat - 2].hand if you.seat > 1 else players[len(players) - 1].hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.incoming"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "incoming",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "hand scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "pick_number == picks_per_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(you.tempura / tempura_set_size) * tempura_set_points + int(you.sashimi / sashimi_set_size) * sashimi_set_points + [dumpling_points_0, dumpling_points_1, dumpling_points_2, dumpling_points_3, dumpling_points_4, dumpling_points_5_plus][min(you.dumplings, 5)] + you.nigiri_points"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} scores {value} for tempura, sashimi, dumplings and nigiri."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.maki >= 1 and you.maki == max([p.maki for p in players])"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(maki_first_points / count(p.maki == you.maki for p in players))"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the most maki and gains {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.maki >= 1 and count(p.maki == max([q.maki for q in players]) for p in players) == 1 and you.maki == max([0] + [p.maki for p in players if p.maki < max([q.maki for q in players])])"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(maki_second_points / count(p.maki == you.maki for p in players))"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the second most maki and gains {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tempura",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "sashimi",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "dumplings",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "maki",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "wasabi_unused",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "nigiri_points",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tableau",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} is scored. Hand counts and tableaus reset; puddings stay."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "pudding scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "pick_number == picks_per_hand and hand_number == hands_per_game and max([p.puddings for p in players]) != min([p.puddings for p in players])"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.puddings == max([p.puddings for p in players])"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(pudding_most_points / count(p.puddings == you.puddings for p in players))"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the most puddings: {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.puddings == min([p.puddings for p in players])"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(pudding_fewest_points / count(p.puddings == you.puddings for p in players))"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the fewest puddings: {value}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "advance",
      "label": "advance",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hand_number",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick_number == picks_per_hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick_number",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if pick_number == picks_per_hand else pick_number + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "advance",
      "label": "after the third hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_number > hands_per_game"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_number > hands_per_game"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score * 100 + you.puddings",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final [seat, score, puddings]: {[[p.seat, p.score, p.puddings] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 27,
    "rounds_max": 30,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Sushi Draft uses a {deck_size}-card deck: {count_tempura} Tempura, {count_sashimi} Sashimi, {count_dumpling} Dumpling, {count_maki_1} Maki-1 (1 maki icon), {count_maki_2} Maki-2 (2 icons), {count_maki_3} Maki-3 (3 icons), {count_salmon_nigiri} Salmon Nigiri, {count_squid_nigiri} Squid Nigiri, {count_egg_nigiri} Egg Nigiri, {count_pudding} Pudding and {count_wasabi} Wasabi. The deck is shuffled once at the start of the game. Everyone starts with score {starting_score} and {starting_puddings} puddings.\n\nThe game has {hands_per_game} hands. Each hand has {hand_size_3_players} picks with 3 players or {hand_size_4_players} picks with 4 players, so the game lasts {rounds_3_players} or {rounds_4_players} rounds. One round is one pick. There is no talk.\n\nEach round:\n1. Deal (first pick of a hand only): each player is dealt a hand from the top of the deck, {hand_size_3_players} cards with 3 players or {hand_size_4_players} cards with 4 players. Undealt cards stay hidden and are not reshuffled.\n2. Announce: everyone is told every player's face-up cards for this hand, every player's pudding count and score, and how many cards each hand holds. You alone are shown the cards in your own hand.\n3. Pick: all players at the same moment secretly choose one card from their own hand. Nobody sees another's choice until all have chosen. If your hand holds one card, that card is taken automatically and you are not asked.\n4. Reveal: all chosen cards are revealed at once; each leaves its owner's hand and is placed face up in front of them.\n5. Record the chosen card: Tempura adds 1 to your tempura count. Sashimi adds 1 to your sashimi count. Dumpling adds 1 to your dumpling count. Maki adds its icons ({maki_icons_1}, {maki_icons_2} or {maki_icons_3}) to your maki total. Pudding adds 1 to your puddings, which are kept across all hands. Wasabi adds 1 to your unused wasabi. Nigiri is worth {egg_value} (Egg), {salmon_value} (Salmon) or {squid_value} (Squid). If you have at least 1 unused wasabi, the nigiri is placed on it: its value is multiplied by {wasabi_multiplier} (3, 6 or 9) and your unused wasabi drops by 1. If you have no unused wasabi, the nigiri keeps its plain value. Add the nigiri's value to your nigiri points for this hand.\n6. Pass: everyone passes their remaining hand to the player on their left (seat 1 to seat 2, and so on; the last seat to seat 1).\n7. Hand scoring (last pick of a hand only). Each player adds to their score:\n- Tempura: {tempura_set_points} points per complete set of {tempura_set_size} (for example, 3 tempura gives 5).\n- Sashimi: {sashimi_set_points} points per complete set of {sashimi_set_size} (for example, 5 sashimi gives 10).\n- Dumplings: {dumpling_points_0} for 0, {dumpling_points_1} for 1, {dumpling_points_2} for 2, {dumpling_points_3} for 3, {dumpling_points_4} for 4, and {dumpling_points_5_plus} for 5 or more.\n- Nigiri: all nigiri points for the hand. Unused wasabi scores 0.\n- Maki: among players with a maki total of at least 1, those with the highest total split {maki_first_points} points equally, rounded down. If exactly one player has the highest total, the players with the second-highest total (at least 1) split {maki_second_points} points equally, rounded down. If two or more players tie for highest, no second-place points are awarded. A player with maki 0 scores no maki points.\nThen every hand-only count (tempura, sashimi, dumplings, maki, unused wasabi, nigiri points) and the face-up cards reset. Puddings stay.\n8. Pudding scoring (last pick of the third hand only): players with the most puddings split +{pudding_most_points} equally, rounded down. Players with the fewest puddings split {pudding_fewest_points} equally, rounded toward zero (two tied players get -3 each). Players with 0 puddings count for the fewest. If all players have the same number of puddings, nobody scores for pudding.\n9. After the last pick of the third hand, the game ends.\n\nThe highest score wins. If two or more players tie for the highest score, the one among them with the most puddings wins. Players still tied share the win."
}
